REQUEST='Prepare a national briefing for {name}, about 250 words: explain the documented priorities and relevant qualifications; evaluate the hypothetical proposal and give a concrete, feasible recommendation with a trade-off; distinguish actual source commitments from analyst recommendations and say whether this proposal guarantees support for a future Council text. Preserve material national details. This is policy application, not vote forecasting.'
